;; method-member-of? and its helpers reimplement, for the native model, jdk26u
;; (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259)'s
;; src/jdk.compiler/share/classes/com/sun/tools/javac/code/Symbol.java (MethodSymbol.isInheritedIn,
;; isInheritedIn, hiddenInInternal, isMemberOf), whose notice follows (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"):
;;
